# Marengo

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/rust-patterns.md](../../docs/rust-patterns.md) before editing Rust or proto.

- Run `just check` (container) before completing work.
- Proto changes start in `proto/`; regenerate TS via `consul/npm run gen:proto`.
- Never edit `consul/src/gen/` by hand.
- Libraries: `thiserror` + `?`; no `unwrap` in `crates/`.
- Motor path: Berthier → Davout → robstride; see `docs/safety.md`.
- Use `marengo_support::init_tracing()` in bins; workspace lints forbid `unsafe` unless an ADR allows otherwise.
- Tests must not require hardware in default `cargo test`.
